# This file is machine-specific and should NOT be committed to GitHub.
# Codemagic generates it automatically during the cloud build, so you
# do not need to create it yourself for the Codemagic workflow.
#
# It is only needed if you ever build locally on a computer with the
# Android SDK and Flutter SDK installed, e.g.:
# sdk.dir=/path/to/Android/sdk
# flutter.sdk=/path/to/flutter
